  "method": "Candidate overlay. Unclipped new feature and grass render at 4x with four WORLD pixels of overscan on every side (416x352). Feature/bank edges use analytic signed-distance AA, 0.25 world-pixel ramp; distances round to 1e-9 world px for reciprocal half-alpha stability. Existing alpha-aware Lanczos3 reduces the UNMASKED overscan 416x352 -\u003e 208x176. Crop 4-world-pixel margins AFTER filtering to 384x320 and 192x160, then apply complementary hard half-open polygon ownership at final pixel centers. No per-sprite polygon-edge AA; a future complete-map compositor may AA its outer boundary once. Each port has \u003e=8 straight world pixels and extends beyond cutout by outer radius+4; cubic connectors flatten at 64 steps; junctions merge by minimum distance. No legacy footprint or pixels. Optional road markings=dashed: six-world-pixel light centre dashes, eight-world-pixel nominal dash length and twelve-world-pixel nominal period; eight-world-pixel port phases are reciprocal, curved interiors fit the phase, junction centres remain unmarked. Narrow road borders use darkened pavement.",
